# Play test of Mourner's Deep (CIPlay mourners_deep, in a test world 'CI ...'): a sunken island, 13 m under the sea. No
# quest: down to the graveyard, the grave goods, the gravedigger's shack, its box and the air pocket under its roof.
# Points as in its recipe (heights over the island's own water line).
island Mourner's Deep
offset 0 0
expect animals Angler fish 2
wait 3
kill Angler fish
kill Puffer fish
at -6 4 h=5
open Grave goods
at 4.25 -7.5 h=5
air shackair
at 3.2 -5.2 h=5
open Gravedigger's box
